// Count of kept pairs whose winning labeled hamming appears once.
// When none appear once, that count is not a kept one.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hones ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hones rank

IMPULSE hones 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hones" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
